  "desc": "In GTA 5, the NPCs can feel strangely soulless and unsettling. Despite the world being designed to feel alive, the characters often come across as robotic, emotionless and almost disconnected from reality. Their repetitive dialogue, unnatural reactions and blank expressions create an eerie atmosphere, making them feel less like real people and more like lifeless simulations going through the motions. There’s something genuinely creepy about how they wander around, react to situations and interact with the world, as if they’re alive but lack any real sense of consciousness. It’s almost like Los Santos is filled with people who look human but don’t quite have a soul. #gta5 #gta6 #horror #uncanny #fyp ",
